  "sections": [
    {
      "title": "Grains settle mixed Friday",
      "body": "- December corn settled Friday at **$4.34½**, down 4½ cents, while January soybeans gained 13¼ cents to $12.20¾.\n- December wheat settled at $5.74¼, down 4 cents.\n- Successful Farming's Friday recap called soybean gains double digit and livestock mixed.",
